47
00:04:42,483 --> 00:04:46,803
PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds, or PUBG for short, is at its core a Battle Royale game.

48
00:04:47,204 --> 00:04:52,543
Battle Royale typically means 100 players leap from a plane and parachute to different locations on a large scale map.

49
00:04:52,903 --> 00:04:57,423
The objective is simple, be the last player or squad standing by any means necessary.

50
00:04:57,883 --> 00:05:00,683
How you survive and how you choose to play the game is up to you.

51
00:05:01,063 --> 00:05:03,363
All players begin the game with nothing to defend themselves,

52
00:05:03,363 --> 00:05:07,303
and you must search buildings and nearby areas for weapons, armor, and healing items.

53
00:05:07,663 --> 00:05:12,123
This is referred to as looting, and is typically the very first thing you do after landing.

54
00:05:12,483 --> 00:05:15,644
At the start of the match, loot is randomly distributed around the map.

55
00:05:15,863 --> 00:05:20,383
While some areas are more likely to have better loot, you never know what you'll find in any given location.

56
00:05:20,803 --> 00:05:24,903
It's your choice to parachute into a crowded and dangerous location with large quantities of loot,

57
00:05:25,043 --> 00:05:27,323
or land somewhere quiet with lower quantities of loot.

58
00:05:27,764 --> 00:05:30,764
The loot that you obtain throughout the match might affect how you play the game.

59
00:05:30,764 --> 00:05:34,063
You'll have found a shotgun, then focus on short-range encounters.

60
00:05:34,463 --> 00:05:38,243
Found a rifle and an 8x scope? Explore the mountains and pick off players from a distance.

61
00:05:38,243 --> 00:05:45,223
Early in the game, and shortly after looting, a large circle will be placed randomly onto the map.

62
00:05:45,543 --> 00:05:48,024
This circle is the new play area for all players.

63
00:05:48,423 --> 00:05:50,764
Once inside the circle, the game will continue as normal.

64
00:05:51,083 --> 00:05:53,243
The area outside of the circle is called the blue zone.

65
00:05:53,543 --> 00:05:57,423
If you're caught inside the blue zone, your health will slowly drain until you have no more left.

66
00:05:57,764 --> 00:06:00,403
The play area will continue to reduce in size and phases,

67
00:06:00,403 --> 00:06:04,723
and this encourages you to keep moving, and it also makes it difficult to stay hidden for too long.

68
00:06:04,723 --> 00:06:08,563
Of course, there is a lot more to PUBG than simply staying within the play area.

69
00:06:08,983 --> 00:06:10,764
Utilizing the environment around you is essential,

70
00:06:11,043 --> 00:06:13,543
whether that be hiding inside of a building, using trees as cover,

71
00:06:13,663 --> 00:06:16,223
or finding a hilltop to snipe unsuspecting foes.

72
00:06:16,423 --> 00:06:17,343
It's all fair game.

73
00:06:17,764 --> 00:06:20,783
The sounds you make throughout the match will play a large role in your survival.

74
00:06:21,323 --> 00:06:24,383
Running through a field, firing your weapon, driving a truck down the road,

75
00:06:24,423 --> 00:06:26,024
or simply walking up a set of stairs,

76
00:06:26,363 --> 00:06:28,983
if another player is close by, your presence will be obvious.

77
00:06:29,203 --> 00:06:31,843
But making loud noises can't always be avoided.

78
00:06:32,283 --> 00:06:34,403
You have to walk upstairs, you have to defend yourself,

79
00:06:34,403 --> 00:06:36,343
and sometimes you need to get somewhere fast.

80
00:06:36,743 --> 00:06:38,823
Vehicles are randomly scattered across every map.

81
00:06:39,003 --> 00:06:43,243
You can find 4x4 off-road vehicles, motorcycles, buggies, vans, and more,

82
00:06:43,563 --> 00:06:46,003
each with different capacities, top speeds, and durability.

83
00:06:46,463 --> 00:06:49,723
On top of land vehicles, you can also find various water vehicles,

84
00:06:49,863 --> 00:06:52,504
like boats and jet skis scattered around the edge of the islands.

85
00:06:52,683 --> 00:06:55,504
In Battle Royale, being the last player standing is the ultimate goal.

86
00:06:55,884 --> 00:06:58,463
You may not win at first, but if you can quickly loot an area,

87
00:06:58,683 --> 00:07:00,943
mastering your favorite weapon, and survive into the top 10,

88
00:07:01,283 --> 00:07:02,923
you'll land that number one spot in no time.

89
